{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_18407","headline":"送戴端公赴容州 · 陈羽","name":"送戴端公赴容州","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"分命诸侯重，葳蕤绣服香。\n八蛮治险阻，千骑蹋繁霜。\n山断旌旗出，天晴劒佩光。\n还将小戴礼，远出化南方。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"陈羽","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_18407.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_18407","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}